L["Enables or disables this row. When disabled, abilities assigned to this row are hidden and the row takes no space on the HUD."] = "啟用或停用此排。停用時，指派至此排的技能將被隱藏，且此排不會佔用 HUD 空間。"
L["Size"] = "大小"
