L["Aspect Ratio"] = "長寬比"
L["Override the icon shape for this row. |cffffffffInherit|r uses the global setting from Appearance."] = "覆寫此排的圖示形狀。|cffffffff繼承|r 會使用「外觀」中的全域設定。"
