L["Flow Layout"] = "流動排列"
L["Wraps icons into multiple lines instead of displaying them all in a single long line. The Icons Per Row setting controls the maximum icons per line.\n\nTo avoid a sparse last row, icons are moved down from the previous row — for example, 8 icons at 6 per row becomes 5 and 3 instead of 6 and 2."] = "將圖示換行排成多行，而非全部擠在一條長線上。「每排圖示數」設定控制每行的最大圖示數。\n\n為避免最後一行過於稀疏，圖示會從上一行往下移——例如每排 6 個的 8 個圖示會排成 5 和 3，而非 6 和 2。"
L["Icons Per Row"] = "每排圖示數"
L["The maximum number of icons on each line before wrapping to the next. Rows fill from the top, so earlier rows are always full.\n\nTo avoid a sparse last row, icons are moved down from the previous row — for example, 14 icons at 6 per row becomes 6, 5, 3 instead of 6, 6, 2."] = "換到下一行前每行的最大圖示數。各行由上往下填滿，因此前面的行永遠是滿的。\n\n為避免最後一行過於稀疏，圖示會從上一行往下移——例如每排 6 個的 14 個圖示會排成 6、5、3，而非 6、6、2。"
L["Reorder the vertical layout of the HUD and adjust spacing between elements."] = "重新排列 HUD 的垂直版面，並調整各元素之間的間距。"
L["Up"] = "上移"
L["Down"] = "下移"
L["Gap above %s"] = "%s 上方的間隔"
L["Pixels of space between %s and %s."] = "%s 與 %s 之間的間隔像素數。"
L["VeevHUD"] = "VeevHUD"
L["Version "] = "版本 "
L["General"] = "一般"
L["Global settings that affect the entire HUD. Individual modules have their own tabs."] = "影響整個 HUD 的全域設定。各個模組有自己的分頁。"
L["Position and Scale"] = "位置與縮放"
L["Horizontal Offset"] = "水平偏移"
L["Moves the entire HUD left or right from the center of the screen. Negative values shift it left, positive values shift it right. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "將整個 HUD 從螢幕中央往左或往右移動。負值向左移，正值向右移。範圍會依你的螢幕解析度調整。"
L["Vertical Offset"] = "垂直偏移"
L["Moves the entire HUD up or down on your screen. Negative values move it below center, positive values move it above. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "將整個 HUD 在螢幕上往上或往下移動。負值移到中央以下，正值移到中央以上。範圍會依你的螢幕解析度調整。"
L["Scale"] = "縮放"
L["Makes everything in the HUD bigger or smaller. 100% is the normal size. Increase if you have trouble seeing the icons, decrease if they take up too much screen space."] = "讓 HUD 中的所有內容變大或變小。100% 為正常大小。若看不清圖示可調高，若佔用太多螢幕空間可調低。"
L["Appearance"] = "外觀"
L["Font"] = "字型"
L["The font used for all text in the HUD, including cooldown timers, stack counts, health/resource values, and proc durations.\n\nIf you have font-sharing addons installed (SharedMedia, etc.), their fonts will appear here automatically."] = "HUD 中所有文字使用的字型，包括冷卻計時、層數、生命/資源數值及觸發效果持續時間。\n\n若你安裝了字型分享插件（SharedMedia 等），其字型會自動出現在此處。"
L["Text Color"] = "文字顏色"
L["The color used for cooldown countdowns, duration timers, and stack counts across all HUD elements."] = "所有 HUD 元素中冷卻倒數、持續時間計時及層數所使用的顏色。"
L["Text Outline"] = "文字外框"
L["Controls how text is rendered across all HUD elements.\n\n|cffffffffOutline|r — Font outline only.\n|cffffffffShadow|r — Drop shadow only (cleaner at small sizes).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Font outline + drop shadow (maximum readability).\n|cffffffffNone|r — No outline or shadow.\n\nIndividual elements can override this in their own settings."] = "控制所有 HUD 元素的文字呈現方式。\n\n|cffffffff外框|r — 僅字型外框。\n|cffffffff陰影|r — 僅投影（小尺寸時較乾淨）。\n|cffffffff兩者|r — 字型外框 + 投影（可讀性最佳）。\n|cffffffff無|r — 無外框或陰影。\n\n個別元素可在其各自的設定中覆寫此項。"
L["Bar Texture"] = "長條材質"
L["The texture used for all status bars in the HUD, including health, resource, combo point, and energy ticker bars.\n\nIf you have texture-sharing addons installed (SharedMedia, etc.), their textures will appear here automatically."] = "HUD 中所有狀態條使用的材質，包括生命、資源、連擊點及能量計時條。\n\n若你安裝了材質分享插件（SharedMedia 等），其材質會自動出現在此處。"
L["Bar Gradient"] = "長條漸層"
L["Adds a subtle dark-to-light gradient across all status bars (health, resource, combo points, and energy ticker), giving them more visual depth instead of a flat solid color."] = "為所有狀態條（生命、資源、連擊點及能量計時器）加上由暗到亮的細緻漸層，使其更具視覺層次，而非單調的純色。"
L["Icon Zoom"] = "圖示縮放"
L["Zooms into each icon's artwork, cropping the edges. Affects ability rows and Aura Tracker. Useful for removing the default border that some spell textures have. 0% shows the full icon, 16% is a subtle crop."] = "放大每個圖示的圖案並裁切邊緣。影響技能排與光環追蹤器。可用於移除某些法術材質自帶的預設邊框。0% 顯示完整圖示，16% 為細微裁切。"
L["Sound"] = "音效"
L["Sound Channel"] = "音效頻道"
L["Audio channel for all VeevHUD sound alerts.\n\n|cffffffffMaster|r — Always plays regardless of volume sliders.\n|cffffffffSound Effects|r — Respects the Sound Effects volume slider.\n|cffffffffMusic|r — Respects the Music volume slider.\n|cffffffffAmbience|r — Respects the Ambience volume slider."] = "所有 VeevHUD 音效提示的音訊頻道。\n\n|cffffffff主音量|r — 不受音量滑桿影響，永遠播放。\n|cffffffff音效|r — 受「音效」音量滑桿控制。\n|cffffffff音樂|r — 受「音樂」音量滑桿控制。\n|cffffffff環境音|r — 受「環境音」音量滑桿控制。"
L["Register Sound Kit ID"] = "註冊音效組 ID"
L["Enter a WoW Sound Kit ID (a number) to register it as an available sound. Once registered, it appears in all sound dropdowns.\n\nBrowse IDs at: wowhead.com/sounds\n\nExamples: 8959 (raid warning), 11466 (Illidan), 8174 (PvP flag).\n\nNote: the speaker preview button in dropdowns does not work for Kit IDs, but the sound plays correctly in-game."] = "輸入 WoW 音效組 ID（一個數字）以將其註冊為可用音效。註冊後，它會出現在所有音效下拉選單中。\n\n在此瀏覽 ID：wowhead.com/sounds\n\n範例：8959（團隊警告）、11466（伊利丹）、8174（PvP 旗幟）。\n\n注意：下拉選單中的喇叭預覽按鈕對音效組 ID 無效，但音效在遊戲中會正確播放。"
L["Invalid Sound Kit ID: %s"] = "無效的音效組 ID：%s"
L["Playing Kit ID %s — registered as %s (top of sound dropdowns)."] = "正在播放音效組 ID %s——已註冊為 %s（位於音效下拉選單頂端）。"
L["Sound Kit ID registration failed — LibSharedMedia not available."] = "音效組 ID 註冊失敗——LibSharedMedia 無法使用。"
L["Visibility"] = "顯示狀態"
L["Out of Combat Opacity"] = "脫離戰鬥時不透明度"
L["Controls the HUD's visibility when not in combat. Use this to fade the HUD when out of combat so it's less distracting. 100% = fully visible, 50% = half transparent, 0% = invisible.\n\nNote: This setting is ignored while the config panel is open so you can see the HUD while configuring."] = "控制脫離戰鬥時 HUD 的可見度。可用於在脫離戰鬥時淡出 HUD，減少干擾。100% = 完全可見，50% = 半透明，0% = 不可見。\n\n注意：開啟設定面板時會忽略此設定，以便你在設定時看到 HUD。"
L["Hide on Flight Path"] = "飛行路徑時隱藏"
L["Automatically hides the HUD when you're on a flight path (taxi). The HUD will reappear when you land. Useful to keep your screen clean while traveling.\n\nNote: This setting is ignored while the config panel is open so you can see the HUD while configuring."] = "當你在飛行路徑（坐騎飛行）上時自動隱藏 HUD。降落後 HUD 會重新出現。可在移動時保持螢幕乾淨。\n\n注意：開啟設定面板時會忽略此設定，以便你在設定時看到 HUD。"
L["Animations"] = "動畫"
L["Smooth Bar Animation"] = "平滑長條動畫"
L["Health bars, resource bars, and the resource-cost overlay on ability icons animate smoothly instead of jumping when values change."] = "生命條、資源條及技能圖示上的資源消耗覆蓋層在數值變動時會平滑動畫，而非瞬間跳動。"
L["Smooth Dim Transition"] = "平滑變暗過渡"
L["When icons fade in or out (e.g., dimming on cooldown), the transition is gradual instead of instant. Disable for snappier visual feedback."] = "當圖示淡入或淡出時（例如冷卻時變暗），過渡會是漸進而非瞬間的。停用可獲得更俐落的視覺回饋。"
L["Ability Rows"] = "技能排"
L["Default visual settings for all ability rows. Individual rows can override icon shape in their own tabs."] = "所有技能排的預設視覺設定。個別排可在其各自的分頁中覆寫圖示形狀。"
L["Tip: Install the Masque addon to reskin ability icons with custom button styles."] = "提示：安裝 Masque 插件可用自訂按鈕樣式重新美化技能圖示。"
L["Shape"] = "形狀"
L["Default icon shape for all ability rows. Individual rows can override this in their own settings. Aura Tracker has its own setting under Bars."] = "所有技能排的預設圖示形狀。個別排可在其各自的設定中覆寫此項。光環追蹤器在「長條」下有自己的設定。"
L["Spacing"] = "間距"
L["Icon Spacing"] = "圖示間距"
L["The horizontal gap in pixels between each ability icon within a row. A small gap (2-4) helps visually separate icons. Set to 0 for icons to touch. Negative values allow overlap, which may look better with certain skins."] = "同一排內每個技能圖示之間的水平間隔（像素）。小間隔（2-4）有助於在視覺上區隔圖示。設為 0 讓圖示相鄰。負值允許重疊，搭配某些外觀可能更好看。"
L["Flow Row Spacing"] = "流動排間距"
L["When a row uses flow layout and icons overflow to a second line, this is the vertical gap between lines."] = "當某排使用流動排列且圖示溢出到第二行時，這是行與行之間的垂直間隔。"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Ready Opacity"] = "就緒不透明度"
L["How visible icons are when the ability is ready to use. 100% means fully visible, lower values make ready abilities slightly transparent. Most people want this at 100%."] = "技能就緒可用時圖示的可見度。100% 表示完全可見，較低的值會讓就緒技能略為透明。多數人會設為 100%。"
L["Cooldown Opacity"] = "冷卻不透明度"
L["How visible icons are when on cooldown (for rows with Dim On Cooldown enabled). A lower value (like 30%) makes cooldown abilities fade out so you can focus on what's ready. Higher values keep them visible."] = "技能處於冷卻時圖示的可見度（適用於啟用「冷卻時變暗」的排）。較低的值（如 30%）會讓冷卻中的技能淡出，讓你專注於已就緒的技能。較高的值則保持其可見。"
L["Grey Out Unusable"] = "無法使用時變灰"
L["Makes icons grey when you don't have enough mana, rage, or energy to use the ability, or when you're in the wrong stance. Works the same way as WoW's default action bars.\n\nAutomatically disabled while resting in an inn or city to avoid constant grey-outs on combat abilities."] = "當你的法力、怒氣或能量不足以使用技能，或你處於錯誤的姿態時，使圖示變灰。運作方式與 WoW 預設動作列相同。\n\n在旅店或城市中休息時會自動停用，以避免戰鬥技能持續變灰。"
L["Cooldowns"] = "冷卻時間"
L["How cooldown information is displayed on ability icons."] = "冷卻資訊在技能圖示上的顯示方式。"
L["Display"] = "顯示"
L["Cooldown Text"] = "冷卻文字"
L["Displays the remaining cooldown time as numbers on top of each icon. When enabled, VeevHUD shows its own text and hides text from addons like OmniCC. Select which rows display cooldown text."] = "在每個圖示上以數字顯示剩餘的冷卻時間。啟用時，VeevHUD 會顯示自己的文字並隱藏 OmniCC 等插件的文字。選擇哪些排顯示冷卻文字。"
L["Text outline style for ability icon text (cooldowns, stacks, charges, keybinds)."] = "技能圖示文字（冷卻、層數、充能、按鍵綁定）的文字外框樣式。"
L["Minutes Threshold"] = "分鐘門檻"
L["Remaining times above this many minutes are shown compactly. At the default of 2, 3 minutes 27 seconds is shown as 3m, while 1 minute 45 seconds is shown as 1:45."] = "剩餘時間超過此分鐘數時會以精簡方式顯示。在預設值 2 時，3 分 27 秒顯示為 3m，而 1 分 45 秒顯示為 1:45。"
L["Decimal Threshold"] = "小數門檻"
L["Remaining times below this many seconds are shown with one decimal. At the default of 2, 3.4 seconds is shown as 3, while 1.8 seconds is shown as 1.8."] = "剩餘時間低於此秒數時會顯示一位小數。在預設值 2 時，3.4 秒顯示為 3，而 1.8 秒顯示為 1.8。"
L["Cooldown Spiral"] = "冷卻螺旋"
L["Shows the dark 'clock sweep' overlay on abilities that are on cooldown. This visual helps you see at a glance how much time remains. Select which rows display the cooldown spiral."] = "在冷卻中的技能上顯示深色的「時鐘掃描」覆蓋層。此視覺效果可讓你一眼看出剩餘時間。選擇哪些排顯示冷卻螺旋。"
L["Show GCD"] = "顯示公共冷卻"
L["Controls which rows display the Global Cooldown (GCD) spinner. The GCD is the brief ~1.5 second lockout after using most abilities. Showing GCD helps you see when you can press your next ability."] = "控制哪些排顯示公共冷卻（GCD）旋轉指示。GCD 是使用多數技能後約 1.5 秒的短暫鎖定。顯示 GCD 有助於你看出何時可以按下一個技能。"
L["Behavior"] = "行為"
L["Dim On Cooldown"] = "冷卻時變暗"
L["Controls which rows fade out (become transparent) when abilities are on cooldown. The amount they fade is controlled by the |cffffffffCooldown Opacity|r setting.\n\nRows without dimming stay at full brightness and use greying-out to indicate unavailability instead. Many players keep the Primary row undimmed so their core rotation stays visually prominent."] = "控制哪些排在技能冷卻時淡出（變透明）。淡出的程度由 |cffffffff冷卻不透明度|r 設定控制。\n\n未變暗的排會保持全亮，並改以變灰來表示無法使用。許多玩家會讓主要排不變暗，使其核心循環在視覺上保持顯眼。"
L["Cooldown Sparkle"] = "冷卻閃光"
L["Plays WoW's native sparkle animation when a cooldown finishes. Also triggers after the GCD, matching default action bar behavior. This is purely cooldown-based — it does not check resources or other usability conditions."] = "冷卻結束時播放 WoW 原生的閃光動畫。也會在 GCD 後觸發，與預設動作列行為一致。這純粹以冷卻為依據——不會檢查資源或其他可用條件。"
L["Cooldown Spiral Opacity"] = "冷卻螺旋不透明度"
L["How dark the spiral overlay appears during ability cooldowns. Lower values make it more subtle and transparent.\n\nNote: Even at 100%, the spiral won't completely obscure the icon — WoW's cooldown texture has built-in transparency."] = "技能冷卻期間螺旋覆蓋層的暗度。較低的值會更細緻且透明。\n\n注意：即使在 100% 時，螺旋也不會完全遮蔽圖示——WoW 的冷卻材質本身帶有透明度。"
L["Resources"] = "資源"
L["How resource costs (mana, rage, energy) are shown on ability icons."] = "資源消耗（法力、怒氣、能量）在技能圖示上的顯示方式。"
L["Display Mode"] = "顯示模式"
L["How ability icons show whether you can afford to cast them:\n\n|cffffffffPrediction|r — Extends the cooldown sweep to include resource regeneration time. The icon shows how long until you can actually cast, accounting for both cooldown and resource cost. Energy and Mana predictions are tick-aware and very accurate. Rage falls back to Fill since rage income is unpredictable.\n\n|cffffffffFill|r — Darkens the icon from top to bottom proportional to missing resources. Simple and easy to read.\n\n|cffffffffBar|r — Shows a small colored bar at the bottom of each icon that fills up as you gain resources."] = "技能圖示如何顯示你是否有足夠資源施放：\n\n|cffffffff預測|r — 延伸冷卻掃描以納入資源恢復時間。圖示會顯示距離你真正能施放還有多久，同時考量冷卻與資源消耗。能量與法力的預測會感知回復節點且非常準確。怒氣由於進帳難以預測，會退回使用「填滿」。\n\n|cffffffff填滿|r — 依缺少的資源比例由上往下使圖示變暗。簡單易讀。\n\n|cffffffff長條|r — 在每個圖示底部顯示一條小色條，隨著你獲得資源而填滿。"
L["Show On Rows"] = "顯示於排"
L["Choose which rows show resource cost information on their icons. When enabled, you can see at a glance whether you have enough mana, rage, or energy to cast each ability."] = "選擇哪些排在其圖示上顯示資源消耗資訊。啟用時，你可一眼看出是否有足夠的法力、怒氣或能量施放每個技能。"
L["Show During Cooldowns"] = "冷卻期間顯示"
L["Shows the resource cost overlay on icons while they are on cooldown, so you can see your resource state through the cooldown spiral. When disabled, the resource overlay only appears when the ability is off cooldown."] = "在圖示冷卻期間顯示資源消耗覆蓋層，讓你能透過冷卻螺旋看見自己的資源狀態。停用時，資源覆蓋層只在技能不在冷卻時出現。"
L["Fill Style"] = "填滿樣式"
L["Use Resource Color"] = "使用資源顏色"
L["Uses your resource type color for the fill overlay — red for rage, blue for mana, yellow for energy — instead of the custom Fill Color."] = "使用你的資源類型顏色作為填滿覆蓋層——怒氣為紅、法力為藍、能量為黃——而非自訂的填滿顏色。"
L["Fill Color"] = "填滿顏色"
L["The color of the resource cost fill overlay on icons. Default is black (a dark overlay showing missing resources). Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked."] = "圖示上資源消耗填滿覆蓋層的顏色。預設為黑色（顯示缺少資源的深色覆蓋層）。僅在未勾選「使用資源顏色」時使用。"
L["Fill Opacity"] = "填滿不透明度"
L["How opaque the resource cost overlay appears on icons. Higher values make it more obvious when you can't afford an ability. Applies to Fill mode and Prediction mode's fill fallback (used for rage and when predictions are unavailable)."] = "圖示上資源消耗覆蓋層的不透明度。較高的值會讓你資源不足時更明顯。適用於填滿模式，以及預測模式的填滿後備（用於怒氣及無法預測時）。"
L["Invert Fill"] = "反轉填滿"
L["Inverts the fill direction. Normal: overlay covers from top down showing missing resources. Inverted: overlay fills from bottom up showing current resources."] = "反轉填滿方向。正常：覆蓋層由上往下顯示缺少的資源。反轉：覆蓋層由下往上顯示目前的資源。"
L["Bar Style"] = "長條樣式"
L["Uses your resource type color for the bar — red for rage, blue for mana, yellow for energy — instead of the custom Bar Color."] = "使用你的資源類型顏色作為長條——怒氣為紅、法力為藍、能量為黃——而非自訂的長條顏色。"
L["Bar Color"] = "長條顏色"
L["The color of the resource bar at the bottom of icons. Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked."] = "圖示底部資源長條的顏色。僅在未勾選「使用資源顏色」時使用。"
L["Bar Height"] = "長條高度"
L["Height of the small resource bar shown at the bottom of each icon. Only visible when Display Mode is set to |cffffffffBar|r."] = "顯示於每個圖示底部的小型資源長條高度。僅在顯示模式設為 |cffffffff長條|r 時可見。"
L["Effects"] = "效果"
L["Visual effects on ability icons for active buffs, debuffs, and procs."] = "技能圖示上針對作用中增益、減益及觸發效果的視覺效果。"
L["Aura Tracking"] = "光環追蹤"
L["Abilities that apply buffs or debuffs (like Intimidating Shout, Rend, Renew) show the active duration with a glow while the effect is on a target. After it expires, the cooldown is shown. Disable if you only want to see cooldowns."] = "施加增益或減益的技能（如威嚇怒吼、撕裂、回復）會在效果作用於目標期間以光暈顯示作用中的持續時間。效果結束後則顯示冷卻。若你只想看冷卻，可停用此項。"
L["Target-of-Target Support"] = "目標的目標支援"
L["Also check for your buffs and debuffs on your target's target. Useful for healers tracking HoTs on the tank's target.\n\nExamples:\n- Target the boss, see your heals on the tank (the boss's target)\n- Target the tank, see your DoTs on the boss (the tank's target)"] = "同時檢查你的增益與減益是否存在於「目標的目標」身上。對追蹤坦克目標上 HoT 的治療者很有用。\n\n範例：\n- 鎖定王，看見你在坦克（王的目標）身上的治療\n- 鎖定坦克，看見你在王（坦克的目標）身上的 DoT"
L["Aura Spiral Opacity"] = "光環螺旋不透明度"
L["How dark the spiral overlay appears when tracking active buff or aura durations on icons. Lower values make it more subtle and transparent.\n\nNote: Even at 100%, the spiral won't completely obscure the icon — WoW's cooldown texture has built-in transparency."] = "在圖示上追蹤作用中增益或光環持續時間時，螺旋覆蓋層的暗度。較低的值會更細緻且透明。\n\n注意：即使在 100% 時，螺旋也不會完全遮蔽圖示——WoW 的冷卻材質本身帶有透明度。"
L["Cast Feedback"] = "施放回饋"
L["Plays a brief 'pop' animation (the icon scales up slightly then back down) whenever you successfully cast an ability. Gives satisfying visual feedback that your spell went off. Select which rows show this animation."] = "每當你成功施放技能時播放短暫的「彈跳」動畫（圖示略為放大再縮回）。提供令人滿意的視覺回饋，確認你的法術已施放。選擇哪些排顯示此動畫。"
L["Pop Scale"] = "彈跳幅度"
L["How much the icon briefly grows when you cast a spell. Higher values = bigger pop."] = "你施放法術時圖示短暫放大的幅度。值越高，彈跳越大。"
L["Ready Glow"] = "就緒光暈"
L["Shows a glowing border around ability icons when they come off cooldown and are ready to use. Only triggers while in combat. Select which rows display this effect."] = "當技能冷卻結束並可使用時，在其圖示周圍顯示發光邊框。僅在戰鬥中觸發。選擇哪些排顯示此效果。"
L["Re-trigger Glow"] = "重新觸發光暈"
L["Which rows re-trigger the glow whenever an ability becomes usable again (not just the first time).\n\nOn these rows, the glow plays again every time usability changes (e.g., gaining enough resources, target entering Execute range). Rows not selected here play the glow only once per cooldown cycle.\n\nNote: Reactive abilities (like Execute or Overpower) always re-trigger regardless of this setting."] = "哪些排會在技能再次變得可用時重新觸發光暈（而非僅第一次）。\n\n在這些排上，每當可用性改變時（例如獲得足夠資源、目標進入斬殺範圍）光暈都會再次播放。未選取的排在每個冷卻週期只播放一次光暈。\n\n注意：反應型技能（如斬殺或壓制）無論此設定為何都會重新觸發。"
L["Duration"] = "持續時間"
L["How long each ready glow animation lasts (in seconds). After this time, the glow fades out. On rows with Re-trigger Glow, the glow will re-trigger at this interval each time usability changes."] = "每次就緒光暈動畫持續的時間（秒）。經過此時間後，光暈會淡出。在啟用「重新觸發光暈」的排上，每當可用性改變時光暈會以此間隔重新觸發。"
L["Pre-trigger Time"] = "提前觸發時間"
L["Begin the glow this many seconds before the cooldown completes, so you can prepare your next action. At 0, the glow only appears once the cooldown is fully complete."] = "在冷卻完成前提早這麼多秒開始光暈，讓你可以準備下一個動作。設為 0 時，光暈只在冷卻完全結束後才出現。"
L["Queued Highlight"] = "佇列高亮"
L["Brightens the icon of your next queued ability. Most noticeable on \"next melee\" attacks like Heroic Strike or Maul that stay queued until your next swing, but you may also see a brief flash on any ability queued during a cast or GCD."] = "讓你下一個已佇列技能的圖示變亮。在如英勇打擊或槌擊這類會佇列到下次揮擊的「下次近戰」攻擊上最為明顯，但你也可能在施法或 GCD 期間佇列的任何技能上看到短暫閃光。"
L["Indicators"] = "指示器"
L["Range checking, sorting, and keybind display on ability icons."] = "技能圖示上的距離檢查、排序及按鍵綁定顯示。"
L["Range Indicator"] = "距離指示器"
L["Shows a red overlay on spell icons when your current target is out of range. Shows when an ability is usable but out of range — even during cooldown, giving you a heads-up on positioning. When resources are insufficient, the grey/resource indicators take priority instead.\n\nNote: Only shows when you have a target. Spells without a range component (self-buffs, etc.) are not affected."] = "當你目前的目標超出距離時，在法術圖示上顯示紅色覆蓋層。在技能可用但超出距離時顯示——即使在冷卻期間，也能提醒你注意走位。當資源不足時，則由變灰/資源指示器優先顯示。\n\n注意：僅在你有目標時顯示。沒有距離成分的法術（自我增益等）不受影響。"
L["Dynamic Sorting"] = "動態排序"
L["Automatically reorders icons left-to-right by remaining cooldown, so abilities that are almost ready appear first.\n\nUseful for DOT classes (see which debuff is closest to expiring) and cooldown-heavy classes (see which ability is ready next).\n\nTie-breaker: When multiple abilities are ready, they sort by their original row position — so your row order acts as a priority list and the leftmost icon is always the next best spell to cast."] = "依剩餘冷卻時間由左至右自動重新排列圖示，讓即將就緒的技能排在最前面。\n\n對 DOT 職業（看出哪個減益最接近結束）與冷卻繁重的職業（看出下一個就緒的技能）很有用。\n\n平手判定：當多個技能皆就緒時，依其原始排位置排序——因此你的排順序等同於優先順序清單，最左邊的圖示永遠是下一個最該施放的法術。"
L["Smooth Sorting"] = "平滑排序"
L["Icons slide smoothly into their new position when the sort order changes. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "當排序變更時，圖示會平滑滑入新位置。停用可瞬間重新定位。"
L["Keybinds"] = "按鍵綁定"
L["Displays the keyboard shortcut for each ability in the bottom-right corner. VeevHUD scans your action bars to find where each spell is placed. Modifiers are abbreviated: Shift=S, Ctrl=C, Alt=A (e.g., Shift+X becomes 'SX').\n\nSupports Bartender4, ElvUI, Dominos. If you move spells or change keybinds, the display updates automatically."] = "在右下角顯示每個技能的鍵盤快捷鍵。VeevHUD 會掃描你的動作列以找出每個法術的擺放位置。輔助鍵會縮寫：Shift=S、Ctrl=C、Alt=A（例如 Shift+X 變成「SX」）。\n\n支援 Bartender4、ElvUI、Dominos。若你移動法術或變更按鍵綁定，顯示會自動更新。"
L["Text Size"] = "文字大小"
L["The font size for keybind text in pixels. Larger values make the text more readable but take up more space on the icon."] = "按鍵綁定文字的字型大小（像素）。較大的值讓文字更易讀，但會佔用圖示上更多空間。"
L["Item Counts"] = "物品數量"
L["Reagent Count"] = "材料數量"
L["Shows the number of reagents you have in the top-right corner of spell icons that consume reagents on cast. Examples: Soul Shards on warlock abilities, seeds on Rebirth, Flash Powder on Vanish, Ankhs on Reincarnation."] = "在施放時消耗材料的法術圖示右上角顯示你擁有的材料數量。範例：術士技能的靈魂碎片、復生的種子、消失的閃光粉、轉生的安卡。"
L["Count All Ranks"] = "計算所有等級"
L["When enabled, counts reagents for all spell ranks combined (e.g., all seed types for Rebirth). When disabled, only counts the reagent for your highest learned rank."] = "啟用時，合計所有法術等級的材料（例如復生的所有種子類型）。停用時，只計算你已學最高等級所需的材料。"
L["Consumable Count"] = "消耗品數量"
L["Shows your current bag count in the top-right corner of consumable icons (potions, runes, etc.)."] = "在消耗品圖示（藥水、符文等）右上角顯示你目前背包中的數量。"
L["Status Bars"] = "狀態條"
L["Resource Bar"] = "資源條"
L["Your character's resource bar (mana, rage, or energy)."] = "你角色的資源條（法力、怒氣或能量）。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your current mana, rage, or energy (depending on your class). Appears between the health bar and the ability icon rows."] = "顯示一條呈現你目前法力、怒氣或能量的長條（依你的職業而定）。出現在生命條與技能圖示排之間。"
L["Width"] = "寬度"
L["How wide the resource bar is in pixels."] = "資源條的寬度（像素）。"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["How tall/thick the resource bar is in pixels. Changing this will automatically adjust the position of elements above it."] = "資源條的高度/厚度（像素）。變更此項會自動調整其上方元素的位置。"
L["Text"] = "文字"
L["Text Format"] = "文字格式"
L["Controls what text is shown on the resource bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual resource (e.g., 4523).\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your resource percentage (e.g., 85%).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both (e.g., 4523 (85%)).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum (e.g., 4523 / 5320).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage (e.g., 4523 / 5320 (85%)).\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much is missing (e.g., -797). Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text entirely."] = "控制資源條上顯示的文字。\n\n|cffffffff目前|r — 顯示你實際的資源（例如 4523）。\n|cffffffff百分比|r — 顯示你的資源百分比（例如 85%）。\n|cffffffff兩者|r — 兩者皆顯示（例如 4523 (85%)）。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大|r — 顯示目前與最大（例如 4523 / 5320）。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大 (%)|r — 顯示目前、最大與百分比（例如 4523 / 5320 (85%)）。\n|cffffffff差額|r — 顯示缺少多少（例如 -797）。滿值時隱藏。\n|cffffffff無|r — 完全隱藏文字。"
L["Number Format"] = "數字格式"
L["Controls how numbers are displayed.\n\n|cffffffffAbbreviated|r — Large numbers shortened (e.g., 4.5k, 1.2m).\n|cffffffffFull|r — Whole numbers (e.g., 4523).\n|cffffffffComma|r — Comma-separated (e.g., 4,523)."] = "控制數字的顯示方式。\n\n|cffffffff縮寫|r — 大數字縮短（例如 4.5k、1.2m）。\n|cffffffff完整|r — 完整數字（例如 4523）。\n|cffffffff逗號|r — 以逗號分隔（例如 4,523）。"
L["Font size for the resource text. Larger sizes are easier to read but may overflow small bars."] = "資源文字的字型大小。較大的尺寸更易讀，但可能在小長條上溢出。"
L["Text outline style for the resource bar."] = "資源條的文字外框樣式。"
L["Default Color"] = "預設顏色"
L["Colors the bar based on your resource type — blue for mana, red for rage, yellow for energy. Uncheck to use a custom color instead.\n\n"] = "依你的資源類型為長條上色——法力為藍、怒氣為紅、能量為黃。取消勾選可改用自訂顏色。\n\n"
L["Overridden by Innervate Highlight (mana) and Rage Highlight (rage) when those are active."] = "當激活（法力）與怒氣高亮（怒氣）作用中時，會覆寫此項。"
L["The custom color for the resource bar. Only used when Use Resource Color is unchecked.\n\n"] = "資源條的自訂顏色。僅在未勾選「使用資源顏色」時使用。\n\n"
L["Innervate Highlight"] = "激活高亮"
L["Changes the mana bar color when the Innervate buff is active, giving you immediate visual feedback that your mana regeneration is boosted."] = "當激活增益作用中時改變法力條顏色，立即在視覺上回饋你的法力回復已獲提升。"
L["Color"] = "顏色"
L["The color the resource bar changes to during Innervate."] = "激活期間資源條變成的顏色。"
L["Master toggle for rage bar coloring. When enabled, the bar changes color based on rage thresholds (e.g., flag rage cap risk) and when Heroic Strike or Cleave is queued onto your next swing."] = "怒氣條上色的主開關。啟用時，長條會依怒氣門檻（例如標示怒氣溢出風險）以及英勇打擊或順劈斬被佇列到下次揮擊時改變顏色。"
L["Rage Thresholds"] = "怒氣門檻"
L["Threshold Coloring"] = "門檻上色"
L["Recolor the bar based on current rage. Three tiers (low/mid/high) gated by two thresholds."] = "依目前怒氣重新為長條上色。由兩個門檻劃分出三個層級（低/中/高）。"
L["Low Threshold"] = "低門檻"
L["Below this rage value, the bar uses the Low color. Above it (and below the High threshold), the Mid color."] = "怒氣低於此值時，長條使用「低」顏色。高於此值（且低於高門檻）時使用「中」顏色。"
L["High Threshold"] = "高門檻"
L["At or above this rage value, the bar uses the High color (e.g., bright red to flag rage cap risk)."] = "怒氣達到或高於此值時，長條使用「高」顏色（例如以亮紅標示怒氣溢出風險）。"
L["Low Color"] = "低顏色"
L["Bar color when rage is below the Low threshold."] = "怒氣低於低門檻時的長條顏色。"
L["Mid Color"] = "中顏色"
L["Bar color when rage is between the Low and High thresholds."] = "怒氣介於低門檻與高門檻之間時的長條顏色。"
L["High Color"] = "高顏色"
L["Bar color when rage is at or above the High threshold."] = "怒氣達到或高於高門檻時的長條顏色。"
L["Queued Ability Override"] = "佇列技能覆寫"
L["Queue Override"] = "佇列覆寫"
L["When a swing-reset ability (Heroic Strike, Cleave, Maul) is queued onto your next swing, override the threshold color with a per-ability color."] = "當揮擊重置技能（英勇打擊、順劈斬、槌擊）被佇列到下次揮擊時，以個別技能的顏色覆寫門檻顏色。"
L["Bar color when %s is queued onto your next swing."] = "當 %s 被佇列到下次揮擊時的長條顏色。"
L["Rage Highlight"] = "怒氣高亮"
L["Shows a bright highlight at the bar's current fill point — the glowing line where the filled and empty portions meet. Adds visual polish."] = "在長條目前的填滿點顯示明亮高亮——即填滿與空白部分交界處的發光線。增添視覺質感。"
L["How wide the spark highlight is in pixels. Larger values create a broader, more prominent glow."] = "火花高亮的寬度（像素）。較大的值會產生更寬、更顯眼的光暈。"
L["Overflow"] = "溢出"
L["How far the spark glow extends beyond the top and bottom edges of the bar (in pixels). Higher values create a taller spark that 'overflows' past the bar."] = "火花光暈延伸超出長條上下邊緣的距離（像素）。較高的值會產生更高、「溢出」長條外的火花。"
L["Hide at Full/Empty"] = "滿/空時隱藏"
L["Hides the spark when the bar is completely full or completely empty, since there's no meaningful fill point to highlight in those states."] = "當長條完全填滿或完全清空時隱藏火花，因為在這些狀態下沒有有意義的填滿點可高亮。"
L["Overlays"] = "覆蓋層"
L["Predicted Cost"] = "預測消耗"
L["Shows a darkened section on the resource bar representing the cost of abilities you are currently casting or have queued (e.g., Heroic Strike, Cleave). Gives you a preview of where your resource will be after the ability completes."] = "在資源條上顯示一段變暗的區段，代表你正在施放或已佇列的技能消耗（例如英勇打擊、順劈斬）。讓你預覽技能完成後你的資源會落在哪裡。"
L["Energy Ticker"] = "能量計時器"
L["Shows progress toward the next energy tick (energy regenerates every 2 seconds). Helps you time abilities to maximize energy efficiency."] = "顯示距離下次能量回復節點的進度（能量每 2 秒回復一次）。協助你抓準技能時機以最大化能量效率。"
L["Style"] = "樣式"
L["|cffffffffTicker Bar|r — Shows a separate thin bar below the resource bar that fills as the next tick approaches.\n\n|cffffffffSpark|r — Shows a moving spark overlay on the resource bar itself, which is more subtle."] = "|cffffffff計時條|r — 在資源條下方顯示一條獨立的細長條，隨著下次回復節點接近而填滿。\n\n|cffffffff火花|r — 在資源條本身上顯示一個移動的火花覆蓋層，較為細緻。"
L["Show at Full Energy"] = "能量滿時顯示"
L["Keep the tick indicator running even when at full energy. Useful for timing openers — you can see exactly when the next tick will occur and use energy right before it arrives."] = "即使能量已滿也讓回復節點指示器持續運作。對抓準起手時機很有用——你可看出下次回復節點確切何時發生，並在其到來前剛好用掉能量。"
L["Bar Settings"] = "長條設定"
L["How tall the energy ticker bar is in pixels."] = "能量計時條的高度（像素）。"
L["Bar Offset"] = "長條偏移"
L["Moves the energy ticker bar up or down relative to the resource bar. Positive values move it down, negative values move it up."] = "將能量計時條相對於資源條往上或往下移動。正值往下移，負值往上移。"
L["The color used for the energy ticker bar."] = "能量計時條使用的顏色。"
L["Spark Settings"] = "火花設定"
L["Spark Width"] = "火花寬度"
L["How wide the tick spark is in pixels."] = "回復節點火花的寬度（像素）。"
L["Spark Height"] = "火花高度"
L["How tall the tick spark is relative to the resource bar. Values above 1.0 make the spark extend beyond the bar edges."] = "回復節點火花相對於資源條的高度。超過 1.0 的值會讓火花延伸超出長條邊緣。"
L["Mana Ticker"] = "法力計時器"
L["Shows a moving spark on the resource bar indicating when your next mana tick will arrive. Mana regenerates in periodic ticks, and casting at the wrong time can delay your next tick — this indicator helps you cast at the optimal moment."] = "在資源條上顯示一個移動的火花，指示你下次法力回復節點何時到來。法力以週期性節點回復，在錯誤的時機施法可能延遲你的下次回復節點——此指示器協助你在最佳時機施法。"
L["|cffffffffOutside 5 Second Rule|r — Only shows the tick timer when you haven't cast a spell in the last 5 seconds (when you're getting full spirit-based mana regeneration).\n\n|cffffffffNext Full Tick|r (Recommended) — Always active. After you cast a spell, it predicts exactly when your first full-rate mana tick will arrive and counts down to it. Cast right after the tick completes to get the most mana before your next spell."] = "|cffffffff五秒規則之外|r — 只在你最近 5 秒內未施放法術時（亦即你正獲得完整精神型法力回復時）顯示回復節點計時器。\n\n|cffffffff下次完整回復|r（建議）— 永遠作用。在你施放法術後，它會準確預測你第一次全速法力回復節點何時到來並倒數至該時點。在回復節點完成後立即施法，可在下次法術前取得最多法力。"
L["How wide the mana tick spark is in pixels."] = "法力回復節點火花的寬度（像素）。"
L["How tall the mana tick spark is relative to the resource bar. Values above 1.0 make it extend beyond the bar edges."] = "法力回復節點火花相對於資源條的高度。超過 1.0 的值會讓它延伸超出長條邊緣。"
L["Mana Bar (Druid)"] = "法力條（德魯伊）"
L["Shows a secondary mana bar below the resource bar while in Cat Form or Bear Form, so you can monitor mana for shifting and casting."] = "在貓形態或熊形態下於資源條下方顯示次要法力條，讓你能監看用於變身與施法的法力。"
L["Show a secondary mana bar below the resource bar while shapeshifted."] = "變身時於資源條下方顯示次要法力條。"
L["How tall the secondary mana bar is in pixels."] = "次要法力條的高度（像素）。"
L["Show Spark"] = "顯示火花"
L["Shows a glowing spark at the current fill position on the mana bar."] = "在法力條目前的填滿位置顯示發光火花。"
L["The color used for the secondary mana bar."] = "次要法力條使用的顏色。"
L["Show Mana Ticker"] = "顯示法力計時器"
L["Shows the mana tick spark on this bar while in form. When disabled, the mana ticker only appears on the main resource bar in caster form."] = "在形態中時於此長條上顯示法力回復節點火花。停用時，法力計時器只在施法者形態下出現於主資源條上。"
L["Form Cost Marker"] = "形態消耗標記"
L["Shows a vertical line on the mana bar when your mana is too low to re-enter your current shapeshift form. The line indicates the mana threshold needed, so you can see how close you are to being able to shift back."] = "當你的法力過低、無法重新進入目前變身形態時，在法力條上顯示一條垂直線。此線指示所需的法力門檻，讓你看出距離能再次變身還有多近。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the Druid mana bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual mana.\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your mana percentage.\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage.\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much is missing. Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text."] = "控制德魯伊法力條上顯示的文字。\n\n|cffffffff目前|r — 顯示你實際的法力。\n|cffffffff百分比|r — 顯示你的法力百分比。\n|cffffffff兩者|r — 兩者皆顯示。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大|r — 顯示目前與最大。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大 (%)|r — 顯示目前、最大與百分比。\n|cffffffff差額|r — 顯示缺少多少。滿值時隱藏。\n|cffffffff無|r — 隱藏文字。"
L["Controls how numbers are displayed."] = "控制數字的顯示方式。"
L["Font size for the mana bar text."] = "法力條文字的字型大小。"
L["Text outline style for the druid mana bar."] = "德魯伊法力條的文字外框樣式。"
L["Health Bar"] = "生命條"
L["Your character's health bar with heal prediction."] = "你角色的生命條，附帶治療預測。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your current health above the resource bar. Gives you a quick glance at your survivability without looking at your unit frame."] = "在資源條上方顯示一條呈現你目前生命的長條。讓你不必查看單位框架就能快速一覽自己的存活力。"
L["How wide the health bar is in pixels."] = "生命條的寬度（像素）。"
L["How tall/thick the health bar is in pixels. Changing this will automatically adjust the position of elements above it."] = "生命條的高度/厚度（像素）。變更此項會自動調整其上方元素的位置。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the health bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows your actual health (e.g., 3256).\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows your health percentage (e.g., 71%).\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both (e.g., 3256 (71%)).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum (e.g., 3256 / 4580).\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage (e.g., 3256 / 4580 (71%)).\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much health is missing (e.g., -1324). Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text entirely."] = "控制生命條上顯示的文字。\n\n|cffffffff目前|r — 顯示你實際的生命（例如 3256）。\n|cffffffff百分比|r — 顯示你的生命百分比（例如 71%）。\n|cffffffff兩者|r — 兩者皆顯示（例如 3256 (71%)）。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大|r — 顯示目前與最大（例如 3256 / 4580）。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大 (%)|r — 顯示目前、最大與百分比（例如 3256 / 4580 (71%)）。\n|cffffffff差額|r — 顯示缺少多少生命（例如 -1324）。滿值時隱藏。\n|cffffffff無|r — 完全隱藏文字。"
L["Font size for the health text. Larger sizes are easier to read but may overflow small bars."] = "生命文字的字型大小。較大的尺寸更易讀，但可能在小長條上溢出。"
L["Text outline style for the health bar."] = "生命條的文字外框樣式。"
L["Use Class Color"] = "使用職業顏色"
L["Colors the health bar using your class color (e.g., brown for Warriors, purple for Warlocks) instead of the standard green."] = "使用你的職業顏色為生命條上色（例如戰士為棕、術士為紫），而非標準的綠色。"
L["The custom color for the health bar. Only used when Use Class Color is unchecked."] = "生命條的自訂顏色。僅在未勾選「使用職業顏色」時使用。"
L["Heal Prediction"] = "治療預測"
L["Shows a lighter overlay on the health bar representing incoming heals. The overlay extends from your current health into the missing health area, giving you a preview of where your health will be after heals land."] = "在生命條上顯示一個較淺的覆蓋層，代表即將到來的治療。覆蓋層從你目前的生命延伸至缺少的生命區域，讓你預覽治療落地後你的生命會落在哪裡。"
L["Pet Health Bar"] = "寵物生命條"
L["Your pet's health bar. Automatically hides when no pet is active."] = "你寵物的生命條。沒有作用中寵物時自動隱藏。"
L["Shows a bar displaying your pet's current health. Automatically hides when you have no active pet."] = "顯示一條呈現你寵物目前生命的長條。沒有作用中寵物時自動隱藏。"
L["How wide the pet health bar is in pixels."] = "寵物生命條的寬度（像素）。"
L["How tall/thick the pet health bar is in pixels."] = "寵物生命條的高度/厚度（像素）。"
L["Controls what text is shown on the pet health bar.\n\n|cffffffffCurrent|r — Shows actual health.\n|cffffffffPercent|r — Shows health percentage.\n|cffffffffBoth|r — Shows both.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max|r — Shows current and maximum.\n|cffffffffCurrent / Max (%)|r — Shows current, maximum, and percentage.\n|cffffffffDeficit|r — Shows how much health is missing. Hidden at full.\n|cffffffffNone|r — Hides the text."] = "控制寵物生命條上顯示的文字。\n\n|cffffffff目前|r — 顯示實際生命。\n|cffffffff百分比|r — 顯示生命百分比。\n|cffffffff兩者|r — 兩者皆顯示。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大|r — 顯示目前與最大。\n|cffffffff目前 / 最大 (%)|r — 顯示目前、最大與百分比。\n|cffffffff差額|r — 顯示缺少多少生命。滿值時隱藏。\n|cffffffff無|r — 隱藏文字。"
L["Font size for the pet health text."] = "寵物生命文字的字型大小。"
L["Text outline style for the pet health bar."] = "寵物生命條的文字外框樣式。"
L["The color for the pet health bar."] = "寵物生命條的顏色。"
L["Shows a lighter overlay on the pet health bar representing incoming heals."] = "在寵物生命條上顯示一個較淺的覆蓋層，代表即將到來的治療。"
L["Combo Points"] = "連擊點數"
L["Horizontal combo point display below the resource bar."] = "在資源條下方水平顯示連擊點數。"
L["Shows combo point bars below the resource bar. For Druids, this only appears while in Cat Form."] = "在資源條下方顯示連擊點數長條。對德魯伊而言，此項只在貓形態時出現。"
L["Size & Layout"] = "大小與排列"
L["The total width of the combo points display in pixels."] = "連擊點數顯示的總寬度（像素）。"
L["The height of each combo point bar in pixels. Smaller values create a more subtle display."] = "每個連擊點數長條的高度（像素）。較小的值會產生更細緻的顯示。"
L["Bar Spacing"] = "長條間距"
L["The gap in pixels between each individual combo point segment."] = "每個連擊點數區段之間的間隔（像素）。"
L["The color used for active combo point segments."] = "作用中連擊點數區段使用的顏色。"
L["Aura Tracker"] = "光環追蹤器"
L["The Aura Tracker shows small icons for important temporary buffs — class procs (Enrage, Flurry, Clearcasting), external buffs (Bloodlust, Power Infusion, Innervate), and any custom auras you add.\n\nUse the tabs above to configure which auras to show."] = "光環追蹤器以小圖示顯示重要的暫時性增益——職業觸發（激怒、亂舞、瞬發），外部增益（嗜血、能量灌注、激活），以及任何你新增的自訂光環。\n\n使用上方的分頁來設定要顯示哪些光環。"
L["Enable Aura Tracker"] = "啟用光環追蹤器"
L["Master toggle for the Aura Tracker feature. When disabled, no aura icons will be shown."] = "光環追蹤器功能的主開關。停用時，不會顯示任何光環圖示。"
L["Layout"] = "排列"
L["How big the aura icons are in pixels. These are typically smaller than ability icons since they're just indicators. 20-28 pixels works well for most people."] = "光環圖示的大小（像素）。由於這些只是指示器，通常比技能圖示小。20-28 像素對多數人來說效果不錯。"
L["The gap in pixels between each aura icon when multiple auras are active at once."] = "當多個光環同時作用時，每個光環圖示之間的間隔（像素）。"
L["Makes aura icons shorter by shrinking height while keeping width the same. Useful if you want compact spell rows but prefer aura icons to stay more square and readable."] = "縮減高度但保持寬度不變，使光環圖示變得較矮。若你想要緊湊的法術排，但偏好光環圖示維持較方正、易讀，這會很有用。"
L["Glow"] = "光暈"
L["Edge Glow"] = "邊緣光暈"
L["Shows a glowing animated border around active aura icons, making them stand out and drawing your eye to important buffs."] = "在作用中光環圖示周圍顯示發光的動畫邊框，使其更突出並吸引你注意重要的增益。"
L["Backdrop Intensity"] = "背景強度"
L["Controls the brightness of the soft colored halo that appears behind each aura icon. Higher values make the glow more prominent. Set to 0 to turn it off completely."] = "控制出現在每個光環圖示後方的柔和彩色光暈亮度。較高的值會讓光暈更顯眼。設為 0 可完全關閉。"
L["Backdrop Size"] = "背景大小"
L["How far the backdrop glow extends outward from each aura icon. Larger values create a wider, softer halo."] = "背景光暈從每個光環圖示向外延伸的距離。較大的值會產生更寬、更柔和的光暈。"
L["Animation"] = "動畫"
L["Show Duration"] = "顯示持續時間"
L["Displays the remaining time on aura buffs as text on the icon. Disable if you prefer a cleaner look or if it overlaps with stack counts."] = "在圖示上以文字顯示光環增益的剩餘時間。若你偏好更乾淨的外觀，或它與層數重疊，可停用此項。"
L["Text outline style for aura tracker text."] = "光環追蹤器文字的文字外框樣式。"
L["Slide Animation"] = "滑動動畫"
L["When auras appear or disappear, the remaining icons smoothly slide to re-center instead of snapping instantly. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "當光環出現或消失時，其餘圖示會平滑滑動以重新置中，而非瞬間跳位。停用可瞬間重新定位。"
L["Activation Pop"] = "啟動彈跳"
L["How much the icon briefly grows when an aura activates or refreshes. Set to 100% to disable the pop animation."] = "當光環啟動或刷新時圖示短暫放大的幅度。設為 100% 可停用彈跳動畫。"
L["Sort Order"] = "排序方式"
L["How active aura icons are arranged.\n\n|cffffffffActivation Order|r — First-activated aura appears on the left, newest on the right.\n\n|cffffffffFixed|r — Icons stay in a consistent order based on spell registration (class procs first, then externals, then custom).\n\n|cffffffffLeast Remaining|r — Aura closest to expiring appears on the left. Icons re-sort as durations tick down."] = "作用中光環圖示的排列方式。\n\n|cffffffff啟動順序|r — 最先啟動的光環顯示在左邊，最新的在右邊。\n\n|cffffffff固定|r — 圖示依法術註冊順序保持一致排列（先職業觸發，再外部，最後自訂）。\n\n|cffffffff剩餘最少|r — 最接近結束的光環顯示在左邊。圖示會隨持續時間倒數而重新排序。"
L["Activation Order"] = "啟動順序"
L["Fixed"] = "固定"
L["Least Remaining"] = "剩餘最少"
L["Bars"] = "長條"
L["Auras set to \"Bar\" mode (via the Display dropdown in the aura list tabs) render as a vertical stack of timer bars below the icon row. These settings control how those bars look."] = "設為「長條」模式的光環（透過光環清單分頁中的「顯示」下拉選單）會在圖示排下方呈現為垂直堆疊的計時條。這些設定控制那些長條的外觀。"
L["Bar Width"] = "長條寬度"
L["Width of each timer bar in pixels."] = "每個計時條的寬度（像素）。"
L["Height of each timer bar in pixels. The spell icon is sized to match."] = "每個計時條的高度（像素）。法術圖示會調整大小以配合。"
L["Vertical gap in pixels between stacked bars."] = "堆疊長條之間的垂直間隔（像素）。"
L["Font size for the bar's name and timer text."] = "長條名稱與計時文字的字型大小。"
L["Text outline style for bar text."] = "長條文字的文字外框樣式。"
L["Fallback fill color for bars whose spell has no icon-sampled color (most do). Each aura's color is normally taken from its icon; you can override per aura in the aura list tabs."] = "當長條的法術沒有從圖示取樣的顏色時（多數都有）所用的後備填滿顏色。每個光環的顏色通常取自其圖示；你可在光環清單分頁中為個別光環覆寫。"
L["Show Icon"] = "顯示圖示"
L["Show the spell icon at the left edge of each bar."] = "在每個長條的左緣顯示法術圖示。"
L["Show Name"] = "顯示名稱"
L["Show the aura name on each bar."] = "在每個長條上顯示光環名稱。"
L["Show Timer"] = "顯示計時"
L["Show the remaining-time text on each bar."] = "在每個長條上顯示剩餘時間文字。"
L["Show a spark at the fill edge of each bar."] = "在每個長條的填滿邊緣顯示火花。"
L["Default Sound"] = "預設音效"
L["Sound to play when any aura activates. Individual auras can override this in the aura list tabs."] = "任何光環啟動時播放的音效。個別光環可在光環清單分頁中覆寫此項。"
L["Play on Refresh"] = "刷新時播放"
L["Also play the sound when an aura refreshes (is reapplied while already active). Useful for procs like Mace Stun where each trigger matters. Individual auras can override this in the aura list tabs."] = "當光環刷新（在仍作用中時重新施加）時也播放音效。對如錘類昏迷這類每次觸發都重要的觸發效果很有用。個別光環可在光環清單分頁中覆寫此項。"
L["Swing Bar"] = "揮擊條"
L["Your character automatically fires auto-shots on a timer. If you cast an ability too late in the timer, it 'clips' (delays) your next auto-shot, costing you DPS. The bar turns green when it's safe to cast and red when casting would clip. Once you learn Steady Shot, a yellow zone appears for the window where Steady Shot would clip but instants and movement are still safe."] = "你的角色會依計時器自動發射自動射擊。若你在計時器太晚時施放技能，會「截斷」（延遲）你的下次自動射擊，損失 DPS。長條在安全可施放時轉為綠色，在施放會截斷時轉為紅色。當你學會穩固射擊後，會出現一個黃色區域，代表穩固射擊會截斷但瞬發與位移仍安全的時機。"
L["Seal twisting lets you get two seal procs on a single melee swing by swapping seals right before the hit lands. The bar turns green during the twist window — the last ~0.4 seconds before impact — telling you when to swap to your second seal."] = "聖印交換讓你在攻擊命中前剛好切換聖印，使單次近戰揮擊觸發兩次聖印效果。長條在交換時機——命中前最後約 0.4 秒——轉為綠色，告訴你何時切換到第二個聖印。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer — a bar that fills up as your next auto-attack approaches. Auto-hides between pulls."] = "追蹤你的近戰揮擊計時器——一條隨著下次自動攻擊接近而填滿的長條。在每次戰鬥之間自動隱藏。"
L["Two bars track your main-hand and off-hand swing timers. When both weapons swing at the same time (synced), your Flurry haste charges aren't wasted on isolated off-hand hits, and Windfury extra attacks land alongside your normal swings. Bars turn green when synced and red when desynced — meaning one weapon has drifted ahead of the other."] = "兩條長條分別追蹤你的主手與副手揮擊計時器。當兩把武器同時揮擊（同步）時，你的亂舞加速層數不會浪費在孤立的副手攻擊上，且風怒額外攻擊會與你的正常揮擊一同命中。長條在同步時轉為綠色，不同步時轉為紅色——表示其中一把武器已偏離另一把。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer. Slam resets this timer, so for maximum DPS you want to Slam right after a swing lands (when the bar reaches the end and resets). This avoids losing auto-attack time to the Slam cast.\n\n"] = "追蹤你的近戰揮擊計時器。猛擊會重置此計時器，因此為了最大 DPS，你會想在揮擊命中後立即使用猛擊（當長條到達末端並重置時）。這可避免因猛擊施放而損失自動攻擊時間。\n\n"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer — a bar that fills up as your next auto-attack approaches. Auto-hides between pulls.\n\n"] = "追蹤你的近戰揮擊計時器——一條隨著下次自動攻擊接近而填滿的長條。在每次戰鬥之間自動隱藏。\n\n"
L["Tracks your auto-attack timer for wanding or melee. Only appears while actively attacking and auto-hides when you stop."] = "追蹤你用於魔杖或近戰的自動攻擊計時器。僅在你主動攻擊時出現，並在你停止時自動隱藏。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer. Shows separate main-hand and off-hand bars when dual-wielding."] = "追蹤你的近戰揮擊計時器。雙持時顯示分開的主手與副手長條。"
L["Tracks your melee swing timer in Cat or Bear Form. Bear Form's 2.5s swing is useful for timing Maul. Auto-hides when not actively swinging."] = "在貓形態或熊形態下追蹤你的近戰揮擊計時器。熊形態的 2.5 秒揮擊對抓準槌擊時機很有用。未主動揮擊時自動隱藏。"
L["Shows a weapon swing timer bar that fills as your next auto-attack approaches. Includes class-specific colored zones: Hunter shot clipping, Ret Paladin seal twisting, Enhancement/Warrior dual-wield sync. Auto-hides when not actively swinging."] = "顯示一條隨著下次自動攻擊接近而填滿的武器揮擊計時條。包含職業專屬的彩色區域：獵人射擊截斷、懲戒聖騎士聖印交換、增強/戰士雙持同步。未主動揮擊時自動隱藏。"
L["Width of the swing bar in pixels."] = "揮擊條的寬度（像素）。"
L["Height of the swing bar in pixels (single weapon). Per-class/spec: each class or spec remembers its own height."] = "揮擊條的高度（像素，單一武器）。依職業/天賦：每個職業或天賦會記住自己的高度。"
L["Wand Height"] = "魔杖高度"
L["Height of the swing bar in pixels for wand users (Mage, Priest, Warlock)."] = "魔杖使用者（法師、牧師、術士）的揮擊條高度（像素）。"
L["Dual-Wield Height"] = "雙持高度"
L["Height of each bar when dual-wielding (MH and OH bars shown separately)."] = "雙持時每條長條的高度（主手與副手長條分開顯示）。"
L["Dual-Wield Spacing"] = "雙持間距"
L["Gap in pixels between the main-hand and off-hand bars."] = "主手與副手長條之間的間隔（像素）。"
L["Show a glowing spark at the fill edge of the bar."] = "在長條的填滿邊緣顯示發光火花。"
L["Hide Delay"] = "隱藏延遲"
L["Seconds to wait after the last swing before auto-hiding the bar."] = "最後一次揮擊後等待多少秒才自動隱藏長條。"
L["The fill color of the swing bar. Disabled when class-specific coloring overrides the entire bar."] = "揮擊條的填滿顏色。當職業專屬上色覆寫整條長條時停用。"
L["Timer Text"] = "計時文字"
L["Show Timer Text"] = "顯示計時文字"
L["Show a countdown timer on the bar."] = "在長條上顯示倒數計時器。"
L["Font size for the timer text."] = "計時文字的字型大小。"
L["Text outline style for the swing bar."] = "揮擊條的文字外框樣式。"
L["Class Options"] = "職業選項"
L["Enable Shot Zones"] = "啟用射擊區域"
L["Color the bar by auto-shot timing:\n\n|cffffffffGreen|r — Safe to cast anything and move freely.\n|cffffffffYellow|r — Steady Shot would clip, but instants and movement are safe.\n|cffffffffRed|r — Don't move or cast Multi-Shot (auto-shot animation playing)."] = "依自動射擊時機為長條上色：\n\n|cffffffff綠色|r — 安全，可施放任何技能並自由移動。\n|cffffffff黃色|r — 穩固射擊會截斷，但瞬發與位移安全。\n|cffffffff紅色|r — 別移動或施放多重射擊（自動射擊動畫正在播放）。"
L["Safe Zone (Green)"] = "安全區（綠）"
L["Bar color when it's safe to cast and move."] = "可安全施放與移動時的長條顏色。"
L["Steady Zone (Yellow)"] = "穩固區（黃）"
L["Bar color when Steady Shot would clip, but instant shots and movement are still safe."] = "穩固射擊會截斷、但瞬發射擊與位移仍安全時的長條顏色。"
L["Stop Zone (Red)"] = "停止區（紅）"
L["Bar color when moving would cancel your auto-shot and Multi-Shot would clip."] = "移動會取消你的自動射擊、且多重射擊會截斷時的長條顏色。"
L["Enable Twist Window"] = "啟用交換時機"
L["Highlight the last ~0.4 seconds before your melee swing with a different color — your cue to swap seals for seal twisting."] = "以不同顏色高亮你近戰揮擊前最後約 0.4 秒——這是你進行聖印交換、切換聖印的提示。"
L["Twist Window Color"] = "交換時機顏色"
L["Bar color during the seal twist window."] = "聖印交換時機期間的長條顏色。"
L["Zone Opacity"] = "區域不透明度"
L["Opacity of the background zone indicators that preview upcoming color changes on the bar."] = "預覽長條上即將發生顏色變化的背景區域指示器之不透明度。"
L["Melee Weaving"] = "近戰穿插"
L["Show both ranged and melee swing bars simultaneously. For advanced hunters who weave melee attacks (e.g., Raptor Strike) between auto-shots."] = "同時顯示遠程與近戰揮擊條。適合在自動射擊之間穿插近戰攻擊（例如猛禽一擊）的進階獵人。"
L["Enable Sync Colors"] = "啟用同步顏色"
L["Sync Threshold"] = "同步門檻"
L["Spell Config"] = "法術設定"
L["Spells"] = "法術"
L["Click the button below to open the spell configuration window — enable/disable spells, reorder them, and drag between rows."] = "點擊下方按鈕開啟法術設定視窗——啟用/停用法術、重新排序，並在各排之間拖曳。"
L["Open Spell Configuration"] = "開啟法術設定"
L["Opens the spell configuration window where you can enable/disable spells, reorder them, and move them between rows using drag-and-drop."] = "開啟法術設定視窗，你可在其中啟用/停用法術、重新排序，並以拖放方式在各排之間移動。"
L["Consumables"] = "消耗品"
L["Track combat consumables on your HUD — potions, runes, and other items you use mid-fight. Each icon shows the item cooldown, buff duration, and bag count. For long-duration pre-pull buffs (elixirs, flasks, food), use a consumable-tracking addon like NovaConsumesHelper."] = "在你的 HUD 上追蹤戰鬥消耗品——藥水、符文及其他你在戰鬥中使用的物品。每個圖示顯示物品冷卻、增益持續時間及背包數量。對於長效的開戰前增益（藥劑、合劑、食物），請使用如 NovaConsumesHelper 的消耗品追蹤插件。"
L["Spec not yet detected"] = "尚未偵測到天賦"
L["Add Consumables"] = "新增消耗品"
L["Add by Item ID"] = "依物品 ID 新增"
L["Enter an item ID to track any consumable not listed above. You can find item IDs on Wowhead (the number in the URL) or with the idTip addon."] = "輸入物品 ID 以追蹤上方未列出的任何消耗品。你可在 Wowhead 上（網址中的數字）或透過 idTip 插件找到物品 ID。"
L["Invalid input — enter a numeric item ID."] = "無效的輸入——請輸入數字物品 ID。"
L["Added:"] = "已新增："
L["Tracked Consumables"] = "追蹤中的消耗品"
L["Sounds"] = "音效"
L["Play a sound when an ability becomes ready — when it comes off cooldown, becomes usable, or meets resource requirements. Set a default sound for all abilities, or override individual spells below.\n\nSound plays for all rows regardless of the Ready Glow row filter. Other settings still apply: combat-only, pre-trigger time, and once vs. re-trigger mode."] = "當技能變得就緒時播放音效——當它冷卻結束、變得可用，或滿足資源需求時。為所有技能設定一個預設音效，或在下方覆寫個別法術。\n\n無論「就緒光暈」的排篩選為何，音效都會對所有排播放。其他設定仍適用：僅戰鬥、提前觸發時間，以及單次與重新觸發模式。"
L["Support"] = "支援"
L["Veev Addons Discord"] = "Veev Addons Discord"
L["Discord URL"] = "Discord 網址"
L["Press Ctrl+C to copy the URL."] = "按 Ctrl+C 複製網址。"
L["VeevHUD is built with a $200/mo Claude subscription, late-night coding sessions, and unhealthy amounts of caffeine. I code for the love of the game, not for profit. Donations to help offset the costs are appreciated but never expected!"] = "VeevHUD 是以每月 200 美元的 Claude 訂閱、深夜的程式開發，以及不健康份量的咖啡因打造而成。我寫程式是出於對遊戲的熱愛，而非為了營利。若你願意捐款協助分攤成本，我深表感激，但絕不強求！"
L["Donate URL"] = "捐款網址"
L["Cooldown Pulse"] = "冷卻脈衝"
L["Flashes a large icon in the center of the screen when a tracked ability comes off cooldown. A prominent visual cue that complements the ready glow on ability icons."] = "當追蹤的技能冷卻結束時，在螢幕中央閃現一個大圖示。這是搭配技能圖示就緒光暈的醒目視覺提示。"
L["Enable Cooldown Pulse"] = "啟用冷卻脈衝"
L["Master toggle for the cooldown pulse effect. When enabled, a large icon briefly flashes on screen each time a tracked ability finishes its cooldown."] = "冷卻脈衝效果的主開關。啟用時，每當追蹤的技能完成其冷卻，螢幕上就會短暫閃現一個大圖示。"
L["How large the flashing icon appears on screen, in pixels."] = "閃現圖示在螢幕上的大小（像素）。"
L["Peak opacity of the icon during the flash. Lower values create a more subtle, ghostly effect."] = "圖示在閃現期間的最高不透明度。較低的值會產生更細緻、若隱若現的效果。"
L["X Offset"] = "X 偏移"
L["Horizontal offset from the center of your screen. Negative values move left, positive values move right."] = "相對於螢幕中央的水平偏移。負值往左移，正值往右移。"
L["Y Offset"] = "Y 偏移"
L["Vertical offset from the center of your screen. Negative values move down, positive values move up."] = "相對於螢幕中央的垂直偏移。負值往下移，正值往上移。"
L["Filtering"] = "篩選"
L["Which ability rows trigger the cooldown pulse. Primary Row is your core rotation — the most impactful notifications. Add Secondary to include throughput cooldowns too."] = "哪些技能排會觸發冷卻脈衝。主要排是你的核心循環——最具影響力的通知。加入次要排可一併納入輸出爆發冷卻。"
L["Only In Combat"] = "僅在戰鬥中"
L["Only show cooldown pulses while you are in combat."] = "僅在你處於戰鬥中時顯示冷卻脈衝。"
L["Ignore Cooldowns Below"] = "忽略低於此值的冷卻"
L["Skip pulses for abilities with cooldowns shorter than this. Useful for filtering out short-cooldown rotational spells. Set to 0 to include everything."] = "略過冷卻時間短於此值的技能脈衝。可用於過濾掉短冷卻的循環法術。設為 0 可納入全部。"
L["Fade In Effect"] = "淡入效果"
L["Size effect while the icon fades in. Grow: starts small, grows to normal. Shrink: starts big, shrinks to normal. None: no size change."] = "圖示淡入時的大小效果。放大：從小開始，長大到正常。縮小：從大開始，縮到正常。無：不改變大小。"
L["Grow"] = "放大"
L["Shrink"] = "縮小"
L["Fade Out Effect"] = "淡出效果"
L["Size effect while the icon fades out. Grow: grows from normal to big. Shrink: shrinks from normal to small. None: no size change."] = "圖示淡出時的大小效果。放大：從正常長大到大。縮小：從正常縮到小。無：不改變大小。"
L["Fade In"] = "淡入"
L["How long the icon takes to fade in, in seconds."] = "圖示淡入所需的時間（秒）。"
L["Hold Time"] = "保持時間"
L["How long the icon stays at peak opacity before fading out. Set to 0 for a quick flash, or increase for a longer notification."] = "圖示在淡出前停留於最高不透明度的時間。設為 0 可快速閃現，調高可獲得更長的通知。"
L["Fade Out"] = "淡出"
L["How long the icon takes to fade out, in seconds."] = "圖示淡出所需的時間（秒）。"
L["Early Trigger"] = "提前觸發"
L["Fire the pulse this many seconds before the cooldown finishes. Gives you a head start on reacting. Set to 0 to pulse at the exact moment the ability becomes ready."] = "在冷卻結束前提早這麼多秒發動脈衝。讓你能搶先反應。設為 0 可在技能就緒的確切時刻發動脈衝。"
L["Test Pulse"] = "測試脈衝"
L["Plays a test pulse so you can preview your current settings."] = "播放一次測試脈衝，讓你預覽目前的設定。"
L["No consumables added yet. Select one from the dropdowns above."] = "尚未新增消耗品。請從上方的下拉選單中選擇一項。"
L["Remove"] = "移除"
L["Remove this consumable from tracking."] = "從追蹤中移除此消耗品。"
