L["Own"] = "自己"
L["Others"] = "他人"
L["Icon"] = "圖示"
L["Show this aura as a compact icon in the icon row, or as a status bar with name and timer in the bar stack below the icons."] = "將此光環顯示為圖示排中的緊湊圖示，或顯示為圖示下方長條堆疊中帶有名稱與計時的狀態條。"
L["Fill color for this aura's timer bar (Bar display mode only). Defaults to a vibrant color sampled from the spell's icon — change it here to override."] = "此光環計時條的填滿顏色（僅長條顯示模式）。預設為從法術圖示取樣的鮮明顏色——在此變更以覆寫。"
L["Toggle which class procs are tracked. Enabled procs appear as icons in the Aura Tracker when active."] = "切換要追蹤哪些職業觸發。啟用的觸發在作用中時會以圖示出現在光環追蹤器中。"
L["Show this aura in the tracker."] = "在追蹤器中顯示此光環。"
L["Show the glowing border and backdrop halo when this aura is active. Disable for auras you want to track quietly without the glow drawing your eye."] = "當此光環作用中時顯示發光邊框與背景光暈。對於你想安靜追蹤、不想被光暈吸引目光的光環，可停用此項。"
L["Sound to play when this aura activates. 'None' uses the global default from the Sound section above."] = "此光環啟動時播放的音效。「無」會使用上方音效區段的全域預設。"
