L["Toggle which external buffs are tracked (from other players, consumables, or PvP powerups). These appear as icons in the Aura Tracker when active on you."] = "切換要追蹤哪些外部增益（來自其他玩家、消耗品或 PvP 增益道具）。這些在作用於你身上時會以圖示出現在光環追蹤器中。"
