L["When to show this reminder based on combat state."] = "依戰鬥狀態決定何時顯示此提醒。"
L["Track"] = "追蹤"
L["Who to check for this buff.\n\n|cffffffffPlayer|r: Only check yourself.\n|cffffffffParty|r: Check all party members (or only yourself if solo).\n|cffffffffRaid|r: Check all raid members (downsizes to party if not in a raid)."] = "要檢查誰身上的此增益。\n\n|cffffffff玩家|r：只檢查你自己。\n|cffffffff隊伍|r：檢查所有隊伍成員（若單人則只檢查你自己）。\n|cffffffff團隊|r：檢查所有團隊成員（若不在團隊中則縮減為隊伍）。"
L["Sound to play when this buff reminder appears. 'None' uses the global default from the General tab."] = "此增益提醒出現時播放的音效。「無」會使用「一般」分頁的全域預設。"
L["Min Stacks"] = "最小層數"
L["Show the reminder when stacks fall below this number. Set to 0 to disable stack checking. This is an OR condition with the time threshold."] = "當層數低於此數字時顯示提醒。設為 0 可停用層數檢查。此項與時間門檻為「或」的條件。"
L["Priority"] = "優先順序"
L["Which spell to remind first when no buff from this group is active."] = "當此群組中沒有任何增益作用時，優先提醒哪個法術。"
L["Main Hand"] = "主手"
L["Show a reminder when your main hand weapon is missing an enchant. Disable this if you prefer to benefit from a Shaman's Windfury Totem instead."] = "當你的主手武器缺少附魔時顯示提醒。若你偏好改為受益於薩滿的風怒圖騰，可停用此項。"
L["Off Hand"] = "副手"
L["Show a reminder when your off hand weapon is missing an enchant."] = "當你的副手武器缺少附魔時顯示提醒。"
L["Configure which buff reminders are active. Settings on this tab are per-spec — switching specs loads that spec's configuration."] = "設定哪些增益提醒為作用中。此分頁的設定為各天賦獨立——切換天賦會載入該天賦的設定。"
L["Show Only Known Spells"] = "僅顯示已學法術"
L["Only shows spells you currently know. Disable to see all class buff spells, including ones you haven't learned yet."] = "只顯示你目前已學的法術。停用可查看所有職業增益法術，包括你尚未學會的。"
L["Buff Reminders"] = "增益提醒"
L["Buff Reminders show a large, semi-transparent icon when a long-duration buff you should maintain is missing or about to expire. They are separate from the main HUD icons and only appear when action is needed.\n\nReminders automatically check that you know the spell and have the resources to cast it. Use the Spells tab to configure individual reminders."] = "當你應維持的長效增益消失或即將結束時，增益提醒會顯示一個大型半透明圖示。它們與主 HUD 圖示分開，且只在需要行動時出現。\n\n提醒會自動檢查你已學該法術且有足夠資源施放。使用「法術」分頁來設定個別提醒。"
L["Enable Buff Reminders"] = "啟用增益提醒"
L["Master toggle for the Buff Reminders feature. When disabled, no buff reminder icons will be shown."] = "增益提醒功能的主開關。停用時，不會顯示任何增益提醒圖示。"
L["The size of buff reminder icons in pixels."] = "增益提醒圖示的大小（像素）。"
L["The horizontal gap between buff reminder icons."] = "增益提醒圖示之間的水平間隔。"
L["Icon Opacity"] = "圖示不透明度"
L["The opacity of the buff reminder icons."] = "增益提醒圖示的不透明度。"
L["Text outline style for buff reminder text."] = "增益提醒文字的文字外框樣式。"
L["Pulse Animation"] = "脈衝動畫"
L["Reminder icons gently pulse to draw attention."] = "提醒圖示輕柔脈動以吸引注意。"
L["Respect Resource Cost"] = "考量資源消耗"
L["Only show buff reminders when you have enough resources (mana, rage, energy) to cast the spell. Uncheck to always show reminders for missing buffs regardless of your current resource level."] = "僅在你有足夠資源（法力、怒氣、能量）施放法術時顯示增益提醒。取消勾選則無論你目前的資源量為何，皆對缺少的增益顯示提醒。"
L["Show While Resting"] = "休息時顯示"
L["Show buff reminders while in inns and cities."] = "在旅店與城市中時顯示增益提醒。"
L["Show While Mounted"] = "騎乘時顯示"
L["Show buff reminders while mounted."] = "騎乘坐騎時顯示增益提醒。"
L["When buff reminders appear or disappear, the remaining icons smoothly slide to re-center instead of snapping instantly. Disable for instant repositioning."] = "當增益提醒出現或消失時，其餘圖示會平滑滑動以重新置中，而非瞬間跳位。停用可瞬間重新定位。"
L["Click to Cast (Out of Combat)"] = "點擊施放（僅限非戰鬥）"
L["Makes reminder icons clickable — left-click casts the missing buff. Blizzard restricts addon casting to secure buttons that cannot be moved, shown, or hidden during combat, so clicking only works out of combat — in combat, reminders are visual-only and clicks pass through as normal."] = "使提醒圖示可以點擊——左鍵點擊即可施放缺少的增益。暴雪規定插件只能透過安全按鈕施放法術，而安全按鈕在戰鬥中無法移動、顯示或隱藏，因此點擊僅在非戰鬥狀態下有效——戰鬥中提醒僅為視覺顯示，點擊會照常穿透。"
L["Sound to play when a buff reminder first appears. Individual spells can override this in the Spells tab."] = "增益提醒首次出現時播放的音效。個別法術可在「法術」分頁中覆寫此項。"
L["Position"] = "位置"
L["Horizontal offset of buff reminder icons relative to the HUD. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "增益提醒圖示相對於 HUD 的水平偏移。範圍會依你的螢幕解析度調整。"
L["Vertical offset of buff reminder icons relative to the HUD. The range adjusts to your screen resolution."] = "增益提醒圖示相對於 HUD 的垂直偏移。範圍會依你的螢幕解析度調整。"
L["Toggle a sample buff reminder icon so you can see your settings in action."] = "切換一個範例增益提醒圖示，讓你看見你的設定實際運作的效果。"
L["Default"] = "預設"
L["Sound to play when the ready glow activates on any ability. Per-spell overrides below take priority."] = "當任何技能上的就緒光暈啟動時播放的音效。下方的個別法術覆寫會優先。"
