L["HUD Stack"] = "HUD 堆疊"
L["Only attached elements appear here. Reorder them from top to bottom and tune the space between each pair."] = "只有已附加的元素會顯示在此。由上而下重新排列它們，並微調每一對之間的間距。"
L["Move Rows"] = "移動排"
L["Detach any ability row from the HUD stack, then drag it anywhere on the screen. While this tab is open, detached rows show drag handles and other HUD elements close the vacated space automatically."] = "將任一技能排從 HUD 堆疊中分離，然後將它拖曳到螢幕上的任何位置。開啟此分頁時，已分離的排會顯示拖曳把手，其他 HUD 元素則會自動填補空出的空間。"
L["Gap below"] = "下方間隔"
L["Global Cooldown"] = "公共冷卻"
L["GCD Spiral Opacity"] = "GCD 螺旋不透明度"
L["How dark the Global Cooldown swipe appears on icons. Independent from Cooldown Spiral Opacity, so you can hide the cooldown spiral while keeping the GCD swipe visible (or vice versa)."] = "圖示上公共冷卻掃描的暗度。與「冷卻螺旋不透明度」相互獨立，因此你可以隱藏冷卻螺旋但保持 GCD 掃描可見（或反之）。"
L["Move separately"] = "獨立移動"
L["Moves this ability row separately from the shared HUD stack so it can be placed anywhere on the screen. Turning it off returns the row to its configured layout order."] = "讓此技能排獨立於共用的 HUD 堆疊移動，因此可放置於螢幕上的任何位置。關閉此項會讓該排回到其設定的版面順序。"
L["Reset Position"] = "重設位置"
L["Moves this independent row back to the position it would occupy in the shared HUD stack while keeping independent positioning enabled."] = "在保持獨立定位啟用的狀態下，將此獨立排移回它在共用 HUD 堆疊中原本會佔據的位置。"
L["Horizontal Position"] = "水平位置"
L["Fine-tunes this row's horizontal position relative to the center of the screen."] = "微調此排相對於螢幕中央的水平位置。"
L["Vertical Position"] = "垂直位置"
L["Fine-tunes this row's vertical position relative to the center of the screen."] = "微調此排相對於螢幕中央的垂直位置。"
L["Independent row positioning cannot be edited during combat."] = "戰鬥中無法編輯獨立排的定位。"
L["Drag to move %s"] = "拖曳以移動 %s"
