L["Auxiliary Row"] = "附屬排"
L["Row %d"] = "第 %d 排"
L["|cffff0000Warning:|r LibSpellDB not found. Some features may not work."] = "|cffff0000警告：|r 找不到 LibSpellDB。部分功能可能無法運作。"
L["Spec Detection Failed"] = "天賦偵測失敗"
L["LibSpellDB Missing"] = "缺少 LibSpellDB"
L["LibSpellDB is required but not loaded."] = "LibSpellDB 為必要元件，但尚未載入。"
L["|cffff0000FATAL ERROR:|r %s"] = "|cffff0000嚴重錯誤：|r %s"
L["|cffff0000VeevHUD Error|r\n\n%s\n\n%s\n\nThe addon has been disabled."] = "|cffff0000VeevHUD 錯誤|r\n\n%s\n\n%s\n\n此插件已被停用。"
L["|cffff0000Error initializing module %s:|r %s"] = "|cffff0000初始化模組 %s 時發生錯誤：|r %s"
L["New: Auxiliary Row"] = "新功能：附屬排"
L["A new 4th icon row — the Auxiliary Row — is now available. Use it to separate spells you want visually distinct from your main rows, like tracking totems, trinkets, or niche abilities in their own group.\n\nDrag spells into it via Spell Configuration (/vh spells). By default it sits above the Health Bar, but you can reposition it in the Layout tab. It has its own icon size and aspect ratio settings under Ability Rows.\n\nFor Shamans, totem element slots now live here instead of the old standalone Totem Bar. Warriors, Druids, and Paladins get a stance/form/aura indicator showing your current active state.\n\nThe row collapses automatically when empty."] = "全新的第 4 條圖示排——附屬排——現已推出。你可用它來區隔想與主要各排在視覺上分開的法術，例如將圖騰追蹤、飾品或冷門技能歸為獨立的一群。\n\n透過法術設定（/vh spells）將法術拖曳進去。預設情況下它位於生命條上方，但你可在「排列」分頁中重新調整位置。它在「技能排」下有自己的圖示大小與長寬比設定。\n\n對薩滿而言，圖騰元素欄位現在改放於此，取代舊有的獨立圖騰列。戰士、德魯伊與聖騎士則會獲得顯示目前作用狀態的姿態/形態/光環指示器。\n\n此排在無內容時會自動收合。"
L["Got It"] = "知道了"
L["New: Cooldown Pulse"] = "新功能：冷卻脈衝"
L["Cooldown Pulse is a new feature — inspired by addons like Doom_CooldownPulse — that flashes a large ability icon in the center of your screen when it comes off cooldown.\n\nYou can choose which rows trigger pulses (default: all rows), adjust the icon size, opacity, and animation style — or disable it entirely.\n\nConfigure it in the new Cooldown Pulse tab."] = "冷卻脈衝是全新功能——靈感來自 Doom_CooldownPulse 等插件——當技能冷卻結束時，會在你的螢幕中央閃現一個大型技能圖示。\n\n你可以選擇哪些排會觸發脈衝（預設：所有排）、調整圖示大小、不透明度與動畫樣式——或完全停用它。\n\n請在全新的「冷卻脈衝」分頁中進行設定。"
L["Open Settings"] = "開啟設定"
L["New: Sound Notifications"] = "新功能：音效通知"
L["VeevHUD can now play sounds for combat events. All sounds default to silent — configure the ones you want.\n\nSupported on: proc activation (Aura Tracker), ability ready (Spell Config > Ready Glow Sound), and missing buff alerts (Buff Reminders). Each supports per-spell overrides.\n\nSounds come from LibSharedMedia (WeakAuras, SharedMedia packs, etc.). You can also register WoW Sound Kit IDs in General > Sound."] = "VeevHUD 現在可以為戰鬥事件播放音效。所有音效預設為靜音——請自行設定你想要的項目。\n\n支援的情境：觸發啟動（光環追蹤器）、技能就緒（法術設定 > 就緒光暈音效），以及缺少增益的警示（增益提醒）。每一項都支援個別法術覆寫。\n\n音效來自 LibSharedMedia（WeakAuras、SharedMedia 音效包等）。你也可以在「一般 > 音效」中註冊 WoW 音效組 ID。"
L["New: Consumable Tracking"] = "新功能：消耗品追蹤"
L["You can now track combat consumables on your HUD — potions, runes, sappers, and more.\n\nOpen Settings > Spell Config > Consumables tab, then select items from the Potions or Other Consumables dropdowns. Each icon shows the item cooldown, buff duration (if applicable), and your current bag count.\n\nOnce added, consumables appear in the Spell Configuration window where you can drag them between rows or reorder them alongside your abilities."] = "你現在可以在 HUD 上追蹤戰鬥消耗品——藥水、符文、工兵炸藥等等。\n\n開啟「設定 > 法術設定 > 消耗品」分頁，然後從「藥水」或「其他消耗品」下拉選單中選擇物品。每個圖示會顯示物品冷卻、增益持續時間（若適用）及你目前的背包數量。\n\n新增後，消耗品會出現在法術設定視窗中，你可在其中將它們在各排之間拖曳，或與你的技能一起重新排序。"
L["Cleaner Default Icons"] = "更簡潔的預設圖示"
L["Default icon setups have been streamlined across all classes to reduce clutter out of the box.\n\nSituational and niche abilities (melee attacks for hunters, creature-type-specific spells, threat drops, etc.) are now hidden by default. Spammable filler abilities with no meaningful cooldown are also excluded.\n\nAll hidden spells can be re-enabled at any time via Spell Configuration — just drag them into the row you want."] = "所有職業的預設圖示配置皆已精簡，以減少開箱即用時的雜亂。\n\n視情況使用與冷門的技能（獵人的近戰攻擊、特定生物類型的法術、降低仇恨等）現在預設為隱藏。沒有實質冷卻、可不斷施放的填充技能同樣被排除在外。\n\n所有隱藏的法術都可隨時透過法術設定重新啟用——只要將它們拖曳到你想要的排即可。"
L["Spell Configuration"] = "法術設定"
L["New: Aura Tracker Bars"] = "新功能：光環追蹤器長條"
L["Aura Tracker auras can now be shown as status bars instead of icons — each with the aura name, a smooth depleting timer, and the remaining time, stacked together just beneath the Aura Tracker's icons.\n\nFlip any aura between Icon and Bar using the new Display dropdown in the Class Procs, External Buffs, and Custom Auras tabs. Bars are colored automatically from the spell's icon, with a per-aura color override if you want something different.\n\nFine-tune bar width, height, spacing, and text under Aura Tracker > Settings > Bars."] = "光環追蹤器中的光環現在可顯示為狀態條而非圖示——每一條都帶有光環名稱、平滑消退的計時，以及剩餘時間，一起堆疊在光環追蹤器圖示的正下方。\n\n使用「職業觸發」、「外部增益」與「自訂光環」分頁中新增的「顯示」下拉選單，即可在「圖示」與「長條」之間切換任一光環。長條會自動依法術圖示上色，若你想要不同的效果，也可為個別光環覆寫顏色。\n\n請在「光環追蹤器 > 設定 > 長條」下微調長條的寬度、高度、間距與文字。"
