L["When dual-wielding, two bars track your main-hand and off-hand swing timers. When Heroic Strike is queued, your off-hand's dual-wield miss penalty is removed — but MH fire consumes the queued HS. Bars turn red when your off-hand fires right after your main-hand (no time to re-queue HS), and green when there's a comfortable gap. Use a desync macro if they drift together."] = "雙持時，兩條長條分別追蹤你的主手與副手揮擊計時器。當英勇打擊被佇列時，你副手的雙持未命中懲罰會被移除——但主手揮擊會消耗掉已佇列的英勇打擊。當你的副手緊接在主手之後揮擊（來不及重新佇列英勇打擊）時長條轉為紅色，而在兩者間隔充裕時轉為綠色。若它們靠得太近，可使用去同步巨集。"
L["Color both bars by your HS re-queue window. |cffffffffGreen|r when there's time to re-queue HS before off-hand fires, |cffffffffRed|r when off-hand fires too soon after main-hand (no time to re-queue)."] = "依你重新佇列英勇打擊的時機為兩條長條上色。|cffffffff綠色|r 表示副手揮擊前還有時間重新佇列英勇打擊，|cffffffff紅色|r 表示副手在主手之後太快揮擊（來不及重新佇列）。"
L["Color both bars by how well your main-hand and off-hand swings are synced. |cffffffffGreen|r when synced, |cffffffffRed|r when drifted apart."] = "依你主手與副手揮擊的同步程度為兩條長條上色。|cffffffff綠色|r 表示同步，|cffffffff紅色|r 表示已偏離。"
L["If your off-hand fires within this many seconds after your main-hand, bars turn red. Increase if you need more reaction time to re-queue HS."] = "若你的副手在主手之後這麼多秒內揮擊，長條會轉為紅色。若你需要更多反應時間來重新佇列英勇打擊，可調高此值。"
